[{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0172","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0172.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-25114","title":"osCommerce Online Merchant 安装程序未授权配置文件注入远程代码执行漏洞","description":"osCommerce Online Merchant 2.3.4.1 版本安装程序存在未经验证的配置文件注入漏洞。由于安装完成后 /install/ 目录默认仍可访问且缺少身份验证，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可直接访问 install_4.php，通过构造特制的 POST 数据向 configure.php 文件中注入任意 PHP 代码。当应用程序后续包含该文件时，注入的恶意代码即被执行，导致服务器端完全沦陷，攻击者可实现远程代码执行、数据窃取或进一步横向移动。该漏洞影响 osCommerce 2.3.4.1 版本，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2018-25114"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2025-07-23T14:15:32Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:54:44Z","remediation":"立即删除服务器上 osCommerce 安装目录下的 /install/ 文件夹及其所有内容，这是官方安装指南明确要求的步骤。如使用 osCommerce CE Phoenix 等活跃分支，请升级至最新版本（1.0.8.20 及以上），该版本已移除安装脚本的未授权访问问题。若无法升级，在 Web 服务器（Apache/Nginx）配置中添加访问控制规则，拒绝所有对 /install/ 路径的外部请求，例如 Nginx 配置 `location /install/ { deny all; }` 或 Apache 使用 `<DirectoryMatch \"/install/\"> Require all denied </DirectoryMatch>`。同时检查 includes/configure.php 文件是否已被篡改，确认其中无异常 PHP 代码。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/rapid7/metasploit-framework/master/modules/exploits/multi/http/oscommerce_installer_unauth_code_exec.rb","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44374","https://www.oscommerce.com/","https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/oscommerce-installer-unauth-config-file-injection-php-code-execution","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-25114.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-25114.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/0cbbfd20018b392e9b69a82c4ac1297203bfeefd/2018/CVE-2018-25114.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-25114.yaml","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/5784554659c9500df8525e8db4f986630a56d8a1/plugins/oscommerce/oscommerce/CVE-2018-25114.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2018/25xxx/CVE-2018-25114.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6ff73fb4bb99974a2b535c179f337dd820550366/2018/25xxx/CVE-2018-25114.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-25114.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2018/CVE-2018-25114.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2018-25114.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-25114.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0172.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0171","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0171.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-25031","title":"SmartBear Swagger UI 输入验证不当漏洞","description":"Swagger UI 4.1.2 及之前版本存在输入验证不恰当漏洞，远程攻击者可通过构造特制 URL 并诱使受害者点击，在 Swagger UI 中加载并显示远程 OpenAPI 定义内容，从而实施欺骗攻击。该漏洞影响 Swagger UI 全系列版本，官方声称在 4.1.3 版本修复，但第三方证实该版本及后续版本仍受影响。攻击需要用户交互，CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2018-25031"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2022-03-11T07:15:07Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:54:33Z","remediation":"升级 Swagger UI 至 v4.1.3 或更高版本（v5.x 推荐），该版本默认禁用从 URL 查询参数读取配置（`queryConfigEnabled` 默认为 `false`），防止攻击者通过 `?url=` 参数覆盖 OpenAPI 定义文件。切勿将 `queryConfigEnabled` 设为 `true`。如无法升级，在反向代理或应用入口处拦截含 `?url=` 参数的请求，或在使用 SwaggerUIBundle 初始化前检测并拒绝该参数。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/swagger-api/swagger-ui/issues/4872","https://github.com/swagger-api/swagger-ui/releases/tag/v4.1.3","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20220407-0004/","https://security.snyk.io/vuln/SNYK-JS-SWAGGERUI-2314885","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/headless/cves/2018/CVE-2018-25031.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-25031.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c908bbff86d2944f8f8a39e75f549a966c642420/2018/CVE-2018-25031.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/headless/cves/2018/CVE-2018-25031.yaml","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/db471f1997301dc3f7f49ac6ce647b40e74d4e04/data/by-cve/CVE-2018-25031.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2018/25xxx/CVE-2018-25031.json","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/2ac59005f6e227f031caa7bd5f42ccb71cf13dd9/2018/CVE-2018-25031.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/256acfffdec561159f01d27b17d0320e6463101a/2018/25xxx/CVE-2018-25031.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/db471f1997301dc3f7f49ac6ce647b40e74d4e04/data/2018/CVE-2018-25031-h2oa_CVE-2018-25031.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/db471f1997301dc3f7f49ac6ce647b40e74d4e04/data/2018/CVE-2018-25031-wrkk112_CVE-2018-25031.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/db471f1997301dc3f7f49ac6ce647b40e74d4e04/data/2018/CVE-2018-25031-RelicHunt3r_swagger-ui.md","https://github.com/mathis2001/CVE-2018-25031","https://github.com/afine-com/CVE-2018-25031","https://github.com/rafaelcintralopes/SwaggerUI-CVE-2018-25031","https://github.com/nigartest/CVE-2018-25031","https://github.com/KonEch0/CVE-2018-25031-SG"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0171.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0110","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0110.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-16341","title":"Nuxeo 内容管理平台模版注入漏洞","description":"Nuxeo 平台 10.3 版本之前存在服务端模板注入漏洞（SSTI），远程攻击者可通过向受影响版本的 Nuxeo 平台发送特制的恶意请求，利用模板引擎对用户输入的不当处理，在服务端执行任意 FreeMarker 模板表达式，从而实现远程代码执行。该漏洞无需身份认证即可触发，攻击复杂度低，可导致服务器被完全控制。Nuxeo 官方已在 10.3 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2018-16341"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2021-01-05T00:00:00Z","updated":"2021-01-05T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即升级 Nuxeo Platform 至 10.3 或更高版本。该版本修复了错误页面处理中的 FreeMarker 模板注入漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层（如 Nginx/HAProxy）添加规则拦截 URL 中包含 `${` 的请求，或禁用 FreeMarker 的 Execute 类（在 `nuxeo.conf` 中添加 `org.freemarker.template.utility.Execute=false`）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-16341.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/57432302d64f9bc08597d61c88fc5f900569476d/2018/CVE-2018-16341.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/38e315e25498e9628d3adfa5823d07fd5ba15a1d/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-16341.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2018-16341.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-16341-3377.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-16341-3381.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-16341-3382.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-16341-3380.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-16341-3376.yaml","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/f3c8574e6fa1f9c1cd5aeaba5a209af796107b34/Vuln/middleware/nuxeo/CVE-2018-16341.md","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2018-16341.yaml","https://github.com/mpgn/CVE-2018-16341","https://github.com/CN016/Nuxeo-CVE-2018-16341"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0110.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2018/EXP-AVE-2018-0110.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0110.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0608","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0608.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-19953","title":"QNAP QTS 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"QNAP QTS 在 Web 页面生成时对用户输入的转义处理不当，存在反射型跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞（CWE-79）。远程未认证攻击者可通过构造恶意 Web 请求诱导管理员点击，在受害者浏览器中执行任意 JavaScript 代码，窃取会话凭证、篡改页面内容或发起进一步攻击。该漏洞影响 QTS 4.4.2.1231 build 20200302 之前版本、4.4.1.1201 build 20200130 之前版本、4.3.6.1218 build 20200214 之前版本、4.3.4.1190 build 20200107 之前版本、4.3.3.1161 build 20200109 之前版本及 4.2.6 build 20200109 之前版本。CVSS 3.1 评分 6.1（中危），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需权限但需用户交互、范围改变、机密性与完整性影响较低、可用性无影响。QNAP 已在上述版本中修复该漏洞，建议用户尽快升级至修复版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-19953"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-10-28T18:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:50:10Z","remediation":"立即升级 QNAP QTS 至修复版本：QTS 4.4.2.1231 (build 20200302)、4.4.1.1201 (build 20200130)、4.3.6.1218 (build 20200214)、4.3.4.1190 (build 20200107)、4.3.3.1161 (build 20200109) 或 4.2.6 (build 20200109)。登录 QTS 管理界面，进入「控制台」→「系统」→「固件更新」→「检查更新」并安装。若暂时无法升级，建议在防火墙层面限制 NAS 管理端口 (默认 8080/443) 仅允许可信 IP 访问，并启用 HTTPS 强制加密传输。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.qnap.com/zh-tw/security-advisory/qsa-20-01","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-19953","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2018/CVE-2018-19953.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f54d76ab772484c9516adea70c89afaeb5255051/cves/2018/19xxx/CVE-2018-19953.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/ead884849fb03866caf378c89ff35c5ede134634/2018/19xxx/CVE-2018-19953.json","https://github.com/rxerium/rxerium-templates/blob/9027e3321654e19a5cae31a7fc9917246eccd3fb/2018/CVE-2018-19953.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c0a11fc313619dcf9bfdd0db79ab9694b1de45d2/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-19953.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2018/CVE-2018-19953.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2018/CVE-2018-19953.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c0a11fc313619dcf9bfdd0db79ab9694b1de45d2/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-19953.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2018-19953.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/1572299d9cd3b6a8a96bfb39db7c333e8e57ca6f/CVEs/2018/CVE-2018-19953.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0608.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0606","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0606.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-19949","title":"QNAP QTS 系统中命令参数处理不当导致的命令注入漏洞","description":"CVE-2018-19949是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-19949"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-10-28T18:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:50:10Z","remediation":"立即升级QTS至以下版本或更高：QTS 4.4.2.1270（build 20200410）及以上、QTS 4.4.1.1261（build 20200330）及以上、QTS 4.3.6.1263（build 20200330）及以上、QTS 4.3.4.1282（build 20200408）及以上、QTS 4.3.3.1252（build 20200409）及以上、QTS 4.2.6（build 20200421）及以上。升级操作：登录QTS管理账户，进入控制面板 > 系统 > 固件更新，在Live Update区域点击检查更新并安装，或前往QNAP官网支持中心下载对应NAS型号的最新固件手动升级。若暂时无法升级，可临时停用File Station应用以缩小攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.qnap.com/zh-tw/security-advisory/qsa-20-01","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-19949","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2018/CVE-2018-19949.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fc5c3e6f60accc24b7eac4fd31472f0e5fd97f24/cves/2018/19xxx/CVE-2018-19949.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/ead884849fb03866caf378c89ff35c5ede134634/2018/19xxx/CVE-2018-19949.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-19949.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2018/CVE-2018-19949.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2018/CVE-2018-19949.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-19949.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2018-19949.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/1572299d9cd3b6a8a96bfb39db7c333e8e57ca6f/CVEs/2018/CVE-2018-19949.md","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2018/CVE-2018-19949/README.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0606.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0600","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0600.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-19943","title":"威联通 QTS 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"该漏洞涉及QNAP QTS在网络页面生成过程中对用户输入进行转义处理不当，导致跨站脚本（XSS）攻击可持续性。攻击者在网络端无需管理员权限，但需要用户与受害者配合操作，通过精心构造的恶意输入触发漏洞，实现JavaScript代码的执行，从而窃取敏感信息、篡改网站内容或破坏系统完整性。此类攻击需要用户与受害者进行特定的操作配合才能完成，但能够在改变原有权限范围的情况下突破安全控制，造成高保密性、高完整性和高可用性影响，CVSS评分8.0。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.0,"aliases":["CVE-2018-19943"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-10-28T18:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:50:09Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 QNAP QTS 至以下任一修复版本：QTS 4.4.2.1270 (build 20200410)、QTS 4.4.1.1261 (build 20200330)、QTS 4.3.6.1263 (build 20200330)、QTS 4.3.4.1282 (build 20200408)、QTS 4.3.3.1252 (build 20200409) 或 QTS 4.2.6 (build 20200421) 及以上版本。升级前请备份重要数据，通过 Control Panel → System → Firmware Update 进行在线更新或手动下载固件升级。若暂时无法升级，可在防火墙层面限制 NAS 管理界面仅允许可信 IP 访问，并启用 HTTPS 强制加密访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.qnap.com/zh-tw/security-advisory/qsa-20-01","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-19943","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2018/CVE-2018-19943.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fc5c3e6f60accc24b7eac4fd31472f0e5fd97f24/cves/2018/19xxx/CVE-2018-19943.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/617f5713eaf60aa312a8e3fe5c9942eeb7cf98ee/2018/19xxx/CVE-2018-19943.json","https://github.com/rxerium/rxerium-templates/blob/9027e3321654e19a5cae31a7fc9917246eccd3fb/2018/CVE-2018-19943.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-19943.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2018/CVE-2018-19943.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2018/CVE-2018-19943.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-19943.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2018-19943.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2018/CVE-2018-19943.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0600.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0194","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0194.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-7282","title":"TI-Tool TITool PrintMonitor SQL注入漏洞","description":"TI-Tool TITool PrintMonitor 登录接口的 username 参数存在 SQL 注入漏洞，攻击者可在未经认证的情况下向该参数注入恶意的 SQL 语句，利用 AND/OR 时间盲注技术绕过身份验证或窃取数据库中的敏感信息。该漏洞影响 TITool PrintMonitor 相关版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。目前官方尚未发布修复补丁，建议通过输入过滤或参数化查询进行缓解。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-7282"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-12-06T17:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:02:57Z","remediation":"升级 TITool PrintMonitor 至 PM18.2.1 或更高版本。该版本已修复登录接口 username 参数的 SQL 注入漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面添加规则，对 /login.php 的 username 参数进行 SQL 关键字过滤，并限制登录接口的访问来源 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://print.com","http://ti-tool.com","https://fenceposterror.github.io/cve-2018-7282.txt","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-7282.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2018/CVE-2018-7282.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-7282.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2018-7282.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2018/7xxx/CVE-2018-7282.json","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-7282.yaml","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/5784554659c9500df8525e8db4f986630a56d8a1/plugins/titool/printmonitor/CVE-2018-7282.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-7282.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2018/CVE-2018-7282.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder3/CVE-2018-7282.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2018/CVE-2018-7282.rules"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0194.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0194.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0169","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0169.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-20985","title":"WordPress wp-payeezy-pay插件 本地文件包含漏洞","description":"WordPress wp-payeezy-pay 插件 2.98 版本之前存在输入验证错误漏洞，该插件中的 pay.php、donate.php、donate-rec 和 pay-rec 文件未能正确过滤用户输入，导致存在本地文件包含漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTTP 请求，利用路径遍历技术读取服务器上的任意敏感文件，包括配置文件、数据库凭证等。该漏洞影响所有使用 wp-payeezy-pay 插件低于 2.98 版本的 WordPress 站点，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。建议用户立即升级至 2.98 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-20985"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-22T14:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:53:52Z","remediation":"立即将 wp-payeezy-pay 插件升级至 2.98 或更高版本。该漏洞源于 pay.php、donate.php、donate-rec.php 和 pay-rec.php 文件对用户输入未做充分过滤，导致本地文件包含。如无法立即升级，可暂时禁用该插件，或通过 Web 服务器配置（如 .htaccess）限制对上述四个 PHP 文件的直接访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://wordpress.org/plugins/wp-payeezy-pay/#developers","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-20985.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-20985.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-20985.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2018-20985.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-20985-3507.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-20985-3505.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2018-20985.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/WordPress/CVE-2018-20985.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1cc9b895b10fb3dcc8a308563cbbcfad083cd221/cves/2018/20xxx/CVE-2018-20985.json","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2018/CVE-2018-20985.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-20985.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0169.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2018/EXP-AVE-2018-0169.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0169.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0147","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0147.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-19386","title":"SolarWinds Database Performance Analyzer idcStateError组件反射型跨站脚本漏洞","description":"SolarWinds Database Performance Analyzer 11.1.457 版本的 idcStateError 组件存在反射型跨站脚本漏洞（CWE-79），攻击者可通过构造恶意的 page 参数（/iwc/idcStateError.iwc?page=payload），将 JavaScript 代码注入至页面的 \"Try Again\" 按钮 HREF 属性中。当受害者点击该按钮时，恶意脚本在其浏览器上下文中执行，可窃取会话 Cookie、重定向至钓鱼页面或执行其他客户端攻击。该漏洞 CVSS 3.0 评分 6.1（中危），攻击向量为网络（AV:N），攻击复杂度低（AC:L），无需权限（PR:N）但需用户交互（UI:R），影响范围扩大（S:C），机密性和完整性影响较低（C:L/I:L），可用性无影响（A:N）。受影响版本为 11.1.457，攻击条件为诱导用户访问包含恶意 page 参数的特制链接。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-19386"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-08-14T20:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:49:13Z","remediation":"升级 SolarWinds Database Performance Analyzer 到最新版本（11.1.458或更高版本），官方已发布安全更新修复 idcStateError 组件的 XSS 漏洞。如无法立即更新，建议通过Web应用防火墙禁用对/page参数的反射处理，并添加内容安全策略（CSP）头部以阻止JavaScript执行，实现临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://i.imgur.com/Y7t2AD6.png","https://medium.com/greenwolf-security/reflected-xss-in-solarwinds-database-performance-analyzer-988bd7a5cd5","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-19386.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-19386.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-19386.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-19386.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-19386-3470.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-19386-3469.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-19386-3473.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2018-19386.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/cves/2018/CVE-2018-19386.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/SolarWinds/CVE-2018-19386.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-19386.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0147.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2018/EXP-AVE-2018-0147.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0147.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0133","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0133.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-18570","title":"Planon 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Planon 房地产与设施管理软件在 Live Build 41 之前版本中存在存储型跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。攻击者可通过向受影响系统的输入字段注入恶意 JavaScript 代码，当管理员或其他用户访问包含恶意载荷的页面时，脚本将在受害者浏览器中执行，导致敏感信息泄露、会话劫持或页面内容篡改。该漏洞无需身份认证即可触发，但需要用户交互（点击链接或访问特定页面），CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-18570"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-07-29T23:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:47:31Z","remediation":"立即升级 Planon 至 Live Build 41 或更高版本，该版本已修复输入验证缺陷，阻止恶意脚本注入。如无法立即升级，在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面添加规则过滤 `/<script`、`onerror=`、`onload=` 等 XSS 载荷特征，并对所有用户输入实施严格的 HTML 编码输出。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www2.deloitte.com/de/de/pages/risk/articles/planon-cross-site-scripting.html","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-18570.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-18570.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/db128d7542b824d8791d4750484399f125519466/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-18570.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-18570.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-18570-3443.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-18570-3445.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Planon/CVE-2018-18570.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2018/18xxx/CVE-2018-18570.json","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2018-18570.js","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2018/CVE-2018-18570.yaml","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/dce139c84c439e9fc87d0eb2079ddda89aaeb75c/plugins/planonsoftware/planon/CVE-2018-18570.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0133.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0508","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0508.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-18325","title":"DNN (DotNetNuke) 弱加密算法漏洞","description":"DNN（DotNetNuke）9.2至9.2.2版本使用弱加密算法保护输入参数，攻击者可通过分析加密参数实现信息泄露。该漏洞源于对CVE-2018-15811的不完整修复，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，且无需用户交互。成功利用可导致敏感信息泄露，影响系统机密性。CVSS评分7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2018-18325"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-07-03T17:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:47:00Z","remediation":"升级 DNN (DotNetNuke) 至 9.2.3 或更高版本，该版本已修复输入参数加密算法强度不足的问题。如无法立即升级，可在 Web.config 中启用 customErrors 并配置 HTTPS 强制重定向，同时在应用层对敏感输入参数增加额外的 HMAC 签名校验作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/157080/DotNetNuke-Cookie-Deserialization-Remote-Code-Execution.html","https://github.com/dnnsoftware/Dnn.Platform/releases","https://www.dnnsoftware.com/community/security/security-center","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-18325","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-18325.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-18325.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-18325.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-18325.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/604ddf5b05f9e8ce70a7b6f9716ba166db0bd437/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-18325.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/604ddf5b05f9e8ce70a7b6f9716ba166db0bd437/GHSA/data/2018/CVE-2018-18325.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/604ddf5b05f9e8ce70a7b6f9716ba166db0bd437/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-18325.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates-ai/blob/d476b10507a31f8cf4e68e148600e8de71a53d49/2018/CVE-2018-18325.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2018/CVE-2018-18325.rules","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2018/CVE-2018-18325.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2018-18325.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0508.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2018/EXP-AVE-2018-0508.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0508.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0406","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0406.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-15811","title":"DNN (DotNetNuke) 弱加密算法漏洞","description":"DNN（DotNetNuke）9.2至9.2.1版本使用弱加密算法保护输入参数，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程利用该漏洞。由于加密强度不足，攻击者可逆向解密受保护的参数，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互，CVSS评分7.5，危害等级高。建议升级至修复版本或应用官方安全补丁。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2018-15811"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-07-03T17:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:43:08Z","remediation":"升级 DNN (DotNetNuke) 至 9.2.2 及以上版本，该版本已修复弱加密算法问题。如无法立即升级，可在 web.config 中启用 customErrors 并配置 machineKey 使用强加密算法（如 AES-256），同时限制对 DNN 后台管理页面的网络访问。建议在反向代理或 WAF 层面添加对异常加密参数的检测规则作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/157080/DotNetNuke-Cookie-Deserialization-Remote-Code-Execution.html","https://github.com/dnnsoftware/Dnn.Platform/releases","https://www.dnnsoftware.com/community/security/security-center","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-15811","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-15811.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-15811.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/38e315e25498e9628d3adfa5823d07fd5ba15a1d/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-15811.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2018/15xxx/CVE-2018-15811.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-18325.md","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/d8cd4a1ae21f91a5e3337a6b189b078a1a73a4aa/plugins/dnnsoftware/dotnetnuke/CVE-2018-15811.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-15811.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-15811.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-15811.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates-ai/blob/d476b10507a31f8cf4e68e148600e8de71a53d49/2018/CVE-2018-15811.yaml","https://github.com/rapid7/metasploit-framework/blob/eac2926b138d2c21c1927fef7b940261b9b516f7/modules/exploits/windows/http/dnn_cookie_deserialization_rce.rb"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0406.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2018/EXP-AVE-2018-0406.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0406.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0058","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0058.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-11686","title":"Devaldi FlexPaper 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Devaldi FlexPaper（后更名为 FlowPaper）2.3.6 版本的 Publish Service 组件中 setup.php 和 change_config.php 存在输入验证不当漏洞（CWE-20），未经身份认证的远程攻击者可直接向这两个文件发送恶意构造的请求参数，实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 FlexPaper/FlowPaper 2.3.6 版本，CVSS 3.0 评分 9.8（CRITICAL），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需权限与用户交互，机密性、完整性、可用性均受高危影响。攻击者可直接构造恶意请求利用 setup.php 或 change_config.php 执行任意代码，完全控制目标服务器。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-11686"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-07-03T17:15:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:36:21Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 FlexPaper/FlowPaper 至 2.3.7 或更高版本（官方已修复该漏洞），下载地址：https://flowpaper.com/download/。若暂时无法升级，请立即删除或重命名 Web 目录下的 setup.php 和 change_config.php 文件，或在 Web 服务器配置中禁止访问这两个文件（如 Nginx: location ~* (setup|change_config)\\.php$ { deny all; }），同时限制 Web 目录写入权限，防止攻击者通过 setup.php 写入恶意配置文件实现 RCE。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["https://flowpaper.com/blog/","https://redtimmysec.wordpress.com/2019/03/07/flexpaper-remote-code-execution","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46528","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-11686.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2018/CVE-2018-11686.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/108e5bd2f6b0654ca198ffd5856fd6af45552cd4/2018/CVE-2018-11686.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/66442328eb507ff4cc70a08b8d06ef2b17368786/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-11686.yaml","https://github.com/shadow1ng/fscan/blob/bf036fd9b272a56d493796badcf0a269f0a83ec0/webscan/pocs/flexpaper-cve-2018-11686.yml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/flexpapar/CVE-2018-11686.yaml","https://github.com/zan8in/afrog/blob/9c47a2b9b7e12375757acdfbc179354920c87bd8/pocs/afrog-pocs/CVE/2018/CVE-2018-11686.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9733cd108933bea779970cc29981361e50691314/cves/2018/11xxx/CVE-2018-11686.json","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/xrayFiles/flexpaper-cve-2018-11686.yml","https://github.com/awake1t/linglong/blob/bedbe49597412abab1c1635e133957d782e65325/pkg/pocs/flexpaper-cve-2018-11686.yml","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/1ca878524ec242a39629a3704532139917779e9c/plugins/flowpaper/flowpaper/CVE-2018-11686.yaml","https://github.com/mpgn/CVE-2018-11686"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0058.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0052","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0052.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-11227","title":"Monstra CMS 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Monstra CMS 3.0.4 及更早版本的 index.php 存在反射型跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，攻击者可通过构造包含恶意 JavaScript 代码的 URL 参数诱导受害者点击，受害者访问后脚本在其浏览器上下文中执行，可窃取会话 Cookie、执行敏感操作或重定向至钓鱼页面。该漏洞影响 Monstra CMS 3.0.4 及更早版本，CVSS 3.0 评分 6.1（中危），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需权限但需用户交互、范围扩大、机密性和完整性影响低、可用性无影响。攻击者需诱导用户点击恶意链接，利用方式为构造包含 XSS 载荷的 URL 诱导受害者访问。官方已在后续版本中修复，建议升级至最新版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-11227"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-07-03T16:15:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:35:32Z","remediation":"升级到 Monstra CMS 4.1.5 或更高版本以获取安全更新（CVE-2018-11227 已修复），确保所有用户输入经过 properly html_encode 转义，在前端使用 Content Security Policy 头部限制脚本执行，仅允许自有域名，在配置文件中禁用危险的 PHP 开关，并定期备份系统以防数据丢失。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/monstra-cms/monstra/issues","https://github.com/monstra-cms/monstra/issues/438","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44646","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-11227.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2018/CVE-2018-11227.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/9979ce144c257f1c427a75604f8c0ffbc8293390/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-11227.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-11227.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-11227.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d40bbb471811a29843f023fbf1a8beb3373a987/cves/2018/11xxx/CVE-2018-11227.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/1ca878524ec242a39629a3704532139917779e9c/plugins/monstra/monstra_cms/CVE-2018-11227.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-11227.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-11227.md","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder4/CVE-2018-11227.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2018/CVE-2018-11227.rules"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0052.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0090","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0090.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-14918","title":"LOYTEC LGATE-902 路径遍历漏洞","description":"LOYTEC LGATE-902 楼宇自动化网关的 /webui/file_guest 接口存在路径遍历漏洞（CWE-22）。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标设备发送特制的 HTTP 请求，利用 ../ 序列遍历目录，读取服务器上的任意敏感文件（如配置文件、密码等）。该漏洞影响 LGATE-902 固件版本 6.4.1 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击无需任何权限，仅需网络可达即可利用，可能导致系统配置泄露和进一步渗透。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2018-14918"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-06-28T18:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:41:53Z","remediation":"立即将 LOYTEC LGATE-902 固件升级至 6.4.2 或更高版本，该版本已修复 `/webui/file_guest` 路径遍历漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在网络层面限制对设备 80/443 端口的访问，仅允许受信任的管理 IP 连接，并禁用不必要的 Web 管理接口暴露到公网。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/152453/Loytec-LGATE-902-XSS-Traversal-File-Deletion.html","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2019/Apr/12","https://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2019/Apr/12","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-14918.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-14918.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/38e315e25498e9628d3adfa5823d07fd5ba15a1d/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-14918.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2018-14918.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-14918-3322.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f